{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n狀態大勇的樊亦敏（Amy）在《愛．回家之三代同糖》中的百變造型向來搶鏡，繼今晚以一身浮誇橙色打扮做Intern引發笑料後，驚喜更會再度升級！在之後的集數，她將與車婉婉齊齊換上中學校服，化身Twins手牽手「彈吓彈吓」行路，少女心大爆發，Amy更笑言擔心身高不及對方，場面極具喜感，究竟畫面效果如何？\n</p>\n<h2>樊亦敏浮誇橙裝返工 孖車婉婉穿校服重返校園</h2>\n<p>樊亦敏在劇中的造型百變且充滿驚喜，今晚劇情中，她首日以實習生身份到「跨世代」上班，竟以一身極度浮誇的橙色打扮登場，配上其「離地」兼「說話唔經大腦」的性格，即時引發連場爆笑場面。除了今晚的搞笑演出，Amy在之後的集數更會與車婉婉上演一幕「重返校園」！兩人將齊齊換上中學校服，化身一對孖公仔手牽手，更模仿少女「彈吓彈吓」地走路。據悉她們在拍攝攤位遊戲場口時更是少女心大爆發，玩到忘形唔捨得走，畫面充滿歡樂氣氛。</p>\n<h2>樊亦敏親解百變造型 笑認輸畀車婉婉：佢着得靚啲</h2>\n<p>對於劇中多個搶眼造型，樊亦敏接受訪問時透露是與工作人員共同構思的成果，更笑言今晚的橙色造型是神來之筆：「咁啱我有個橙色袋，就攞出嚟用。」談及與車婉婉穿上校服拍攝，她坦言勾起不少校園回憶，但亦有點擔心：「車婉婉高吖嘛，佢着得靚啲呀，哈哈！不過都幾得意，我哋兩個着得『蠢蠢地』，好似返咗中學嘅時光咁。」她希望觀眾不會覺得有違和感，並直言：「我哋自己就覺得成件事好正。」</p>\n<h2>網民洗版大讚樊亦敏：回憶返哂黎</h2>\n<p>樊亦敏與車婉婉的校服造型劇照流出後，隨即引來網民洗版式討論，大讚造型充滿驚喜。不少網民留言力撐：「Amy姐carry得好好喎！完全無違和感！」、「好想快啲睇到呢集，兩個加埋百幾歲扮學生妹，肯定好好笑！」、「呢個組合好新鮮！車婉婉同樊亦敏好有火花！」、「見到佢哋着校服，啲青春回憶返哂嚟！」、「樊亦敏真係好可愛，個橙色袋好搶！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_17186855696af145a6d3a8f.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_17186855696af145a6d3a8f.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_13633268126af145a9e7a7d.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_13633268126af145a9e7a7d.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_4322823076af145adbbaa8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_4322823076af145adbbaa8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_4402062446af145b02383a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_4402062446af145b02383a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:03:12.032699+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1020,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:10.805621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:10.805621+00:00","content_hash":"f4df296fd2db563284f693326949d60596c0b26020de669befecbce88de92cc3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}